  "description": "Geumyeob Hwang, Part-time convenience store clerk by day, party girl by night.  \nIt seems like a stroke of luck when she lands herself a total hunk at the club with her friends…  \nBut it turns out, he’s actually a 1000-year-old nine-tailed fox, on the prowl for a virgin’s liver!  \nNow, Geumyeob is on the run after swallowing the nine-tailed fox’s bead, with the beast hot on her heels!  \nA new love story brought to you by the people behind , Gali and Heryung Lee!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/47982106), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rain_dogs), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297008102), [Bufftoon](https://bufftoon.plaync.com/series/1001858), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/dw_0444)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7048)\n[Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/11409)",
